      "side": 1,
      "message": "`third_party/google-java-format/google-java-format` shell script requires `$THIS_DIR/cipd/google-java-format.jar` to run correctly [1].\n\nOn Mac/Windows checkout there\u0027s no `cipd/google-java-format.jar` file, because it\u0027s guarded with DEPS condition. But your `glob` call always returns `True`, because it finds `chromium-overrides.jar` which always exist in Chromium checkout.\n\nI\u0027m restoring an explicit check for `cipd/google-java-format.jar` file to fix current depot_tools breakage when java formatter is triggered even when some files are missing.\n\n1. https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/google-java-format/google-java-format;l\u003d18;drc\u003da8d79cbba1c2e74c1727aa1dcabb19cf0f873f07",
